    "detailed_description": "This is a retro, more traditional roleplaying game, the mechanics are a bit unforgiving but there is lots to do! Some of the main features include; <br />\r\n<br />\r\n~ a branching story line, <br />\r\n~ battling mechanics, <br />\r\n~ multiple ways to traverse through areas, in addition to puzzles!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThis game was originally a college project, before becoming a passion project :)<br />\r\nThe game runs at 60fps and has an options menu when hitting the F5 key and a windowed/fullscreen selector with the F4 key",
